# A heart-root (week 34, D-027): bank ichor, buy boons.
# Everything in {{ }}, "do ..." and "[if ... /]" comes from RootTalk
# (src/dialogue/root_talk.gd).

~ start
{{root}}: {{intro}}
if refused
	{{root}}: {{refusal}}
	=> END
=> menu

~ menu
{{root}}: {{status}}
- Pour in your ichor. [if carried > 0 /]
	do bank()
	{{root}}: {{bank_text}}
	=> menu
- {{offer("sense_bodies")}} [if can_buy("sense_bodies") /]
	do buy("sense_bodies")
	{{root}}: {{bought_text}}
	=> menu
- {{offer("hardy")}} [if can_buy("hardy") /]
	do buy("hardy")
	{{root}}: {{bought_text}}
	=> menu
- {{offer("wider_choice")}} [if can_buy("wider_choice") /]
	do buy("wider_choice")
	{{root}}: {{bought_text}}
	=> menu
- {{offer("lasting_graft")}} [if can_buy("lasting_graft") /]
	do buy("lasting_graft")
	{{root}}: {{bought_text}}
	=> menu
- Leave it.
	=> END
